<title>USA: Penn-America sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Penn-America sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HATBORO, Pa. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penn-America Group Inc said Wednesday it had declared a three-for-two stock split, payable March 7, record February 14.</p>
<p>The company, a property and casualty insurance provider, said that after the split it will have 6,688,166 common shares outstanding.</p>
